0,"productionYear":"2026","description":"DIE TRIBUTE VON PANEM \u2013 SUNRISE ON THE REAPING erz\u00e4hlt die Geschichte des jungen Haymitch Abernathy, der 24 Jahre vor den Ereignissen von \u201eDie Tribute von Panem \u2013 The Hunger Games\u201c auserw\u00e4hlt wird, um an den 50. Hungerspielen, dem zweiten sogenannten Jubel-Jubil\u00e4um teilzunehmen. In einem von Misstrauen und politischer Spannung zerrissenen Panem wird ein noch erbarmungsloseres Jubil\u00e4ums-Spiel alles f\u00fcr immer ver\u00e4ndern.\r\n\r\n","contentRating":{"minimumAge":12},"productionCountries":[{"name":"United States"}],"genres":[{"name":"Abenteuer"},{"name":"Science Fiction"},{"name":"Action"}],"directors":[{"name":"Francis Lawrence"}],"actors":[{"name":"Joseph Zada"},{"name":"Ralph Fiennes"},{"name":"Jesse Plemons"},{"name":"Mckenna Grace"},{"name":"Whitney Peak"},{"name":"Elle Fanning"},{"name":"Maya Hawke"},{"name":"Lili Taylor"},{"name":"Glenn Close"},{"name":"Kieran Culkin"},{"name":"Kelvin Harrison Jr."},{"name":"Ben Wang"},{"name":"Molly McCann"},{"name":"Iona Bell"},{"name":"Billy Porter"},{"name":"Jhaleil Swaby"},{"name":"Laura Marcus"},{"name":"Percy Daggs IV"},{"name":"Rada Rae"},{"name":"Sky Frances"},{"name":"Tatyana Muzondo"},{"name":"Alina Reid"},{"name":"Salimou Thiam"},{"name":"Scot Greenan"},{"name":"Grace Ackary"},{"name":"John Doeble"},{"name":"Kaine Buffonge"},{"name":"Kara Tointon"},{"name":"Smylie Bradwell"},{"name":"Jeff Hallman"},{"name":"Serafin Mishiev"},{"name":"Melody Brown"},{"name":"Jefferson White"},{"name":"Iris Apatow"},{"name":"Edvin Ryding"},{"name":"Sandra F\u00f6rster"},{"name":"Jax Guerrero"},{"name":"Devon Singletary"},{"name":"Jennifer Lawrence"},{"name":"Josh Hutcherson"}],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/die-tribute-von-panem-sunrise-on-the-reaping-104293.v17926564062403.jpg"},"trailers":[{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Lk9nOAKNxgE"}]}},{"name":"Wild Horse Nine","beginning":"2026-11-18T20:45:00+01:0